        <h3>{{ loc.name }}</h3>
        <p class="text-muted">{{ loc.state }} · Since {{ loc.established }}</p>
        <p>{{ loc.shortDescription }}</p>
        <p class="card-meta"><strong>{{ loc.activeClients }}</strong> active client sites · {{ loc.responseTimeSLA }}</p>
        <span class="card-link-cta">See {{ loc.name }} details →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>National deployment</h2>
  <p>For enterprise clients with multi-state requirements, we deploy on contract across India — Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Kolkata, Guwahati and other major markets. Our local hiring model means we recruit, train and supervise guards from the deployment region, not parachute them in from Siliguri.</p>
